  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "Are there any hidden charges?",
      "a": "No, absolutely not. The price you see is what you pay. Any additional charges (like ad spend budget) are discussed upfront and with your approval."
    },
    {
      "q": "How long before I see SEO results?",
      "a": "SEO typically shows noticeable results in 3-6 months. However, we often see improvements in rankings and traffic within the first 4-8 weeks."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is there a contract lock-in period?",
      "a": "Our minimum commitment is 3 months for SEO services (as SEO requires time to show results), but there are no long-term lock-ins after that."
    },
    {
